This playground adapts the CopilotKit LangGraph starter at
examples/integrations/langgraph-python (MIT License, copyright Atai Barkai):

https://github.com/CopilotKit/CopilotKit/tree/main/examples/integrations/langgraph-python

The starter's LICENSE is preserved at the repository root. Files descended
from that starter are marked in their headers. The CopilotKit CLI source is
not included.

A2UI is a specification from Google (https://a2ui.org/, Apache License 2.0).
This repository does not vendor the A2UI specification or the @a2ui/web_core
sources. Those ship inside the npm package @copilotkit/a2ui-renderer@1.90.2,
which depends on @a2ui/web_core@0.15.0. The Apache-2.0 text for that package
is in node_modules/@a2ui/web_core after install. Component schemas in
agent/src/a2ui/schemas were written for this playground against the A2UI 1.0
basic catalog; they are not copies of the specification files.
